<h1>Quinnen Williams' $105.9M Extension: <em>The Combine Numbers Behind a 9.84 RAS</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>💰 Breaking · Contracts</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">The Dallas Cowboys signed defensive tackle Quinnen Williams to a three-year, $105.9 million extension this week, making him the NFL's second-highest-paid interior defender. His 2019 combine profile — one of the most athletically dominant testing performances by a defensive tackle in over a decade — explains exactly why teams have paid him twice.</p>
</div><div class="content">
